            //     aerial scout sibling of the Giant Eagle / Hawk /
            //     Pteranodon cohort at the low-CR end.
            //   - Giant Poisonous Snake (CR ¼ medium beast): DEX-based
            //     1d4 bite with a DC 11 CON save-or-3d6-poison rider
